  (text "Reset invalidates volatile grants; reboot must verify firmware and require fresh device PIN.\nPC13=case input; PC1/TAMP_IN3 observes reset/fault line.\nInternal BOR/PVD, clock checks and persistent precharged attempts also required.\nProduction debug lifecycle closed; no populated external debug connector.\nVBAT+LSE must retain tamper with main OFF; full backup loss must lock, not initialize.\nMeasure reset/ENA latency, leakage and injection before security release."
